<title>SWEDEN: Swedish new car registrations up 43 pct Jan.</title>
<headline>Swedish new car registrations up 43 pct Jan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations in Sweden rose 43 percent to 11,714 units, Statistics Sweden said on Monday.</p>
